      "source": "Class for creating Function callbacks around tool list changed consumer methods that\nreturn Mono.\n\nThis class provides a way to convert methods annotated with <a href=\"../../../McpToolListChanged.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpToolListChanged</code></a>\ninto callback functions that can be used to handle tool list change notifications in a\nreactive way. It supports methods with a single List&lt;McpSchema.Tool&gt; parameter.",
      "translation": "用于围绕返回 Mono 的工具列表更改消费者方法创建 Function 回调的类。\n\n该类提供了一种将带有 <a href=\"../../../McpToolListChanged.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>McpToolListChanged</code></a> 注解的方法转换为回调函数的方法，以便以响应式方式处理工具列表更改通知。它支持具有单个 List&lt;McpSchema.Tool&gt; 参数的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
